{"q":"2291","t":"Maximum Profit From Trading Stocks","d":"Medium","p":true,"c":null,"h":["Think of the 0-1 Knapsack Problem.","For the ith stock, the weight is present[i], and the value is future[i] - present[i]."],"m":"{\n  \"name\": \"maximumProfit\",\n  \"params\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"present\",\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"integer[]\",\n      \"name\": \"future\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"type\": \"integer\",\n      \"name\": \"budget\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"return\": {\n    \"type\": \"integer\"\n  }\n}","g":[{"name":"Array","slug":"array"},{"name":"Dynamic Programming","slug":"dynamic-programming"}]}